    "body": "Work cannot start on #3016 alone.\n\nThe parent issue #2938 lists #3012, #3014, and #3015 as prerequisites. All three issues remain open.\n\nOn upstream/main d911f45535df24c42d5fde5feaed386c5fca4907, the schema has no PatternDef. The command module has no pattern folder commands.\n\nNo open PR provides these prerequisites for a stack. The UI must use their undoable commands and verification results.\n\nImplementing those prerequisites here would exceed the assigned scope of #3016.\n\nSTOPPED before claim. No source files changed. No tests ran. Resume after the prerequisites are available.\n",
